    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991870/extras/a389ba7f535f709e7a6f875472481e47.avif?t=1754198413\" width=616 height=308 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploring the Ruins of a Fallen Empire\u2026</h2><br>In a world where empires rise and fall, step into the shoes of an intrepid adventurer as you unravel the enigmatic history hidden within the ruins of a once-mighty civilization..\u2026<br><br>Venture into the heart of darkness and discover the untold stories of a civilization long lost to the annals of time, as you brave the dangers lurking within the ruins of a fallen empire. Ensnared by the convoluted web spun by a dangerous criminal syndicate hailing from a distant land, you uncover a horrifying secret. Will you yield to their manipulation or rise up to fight for what\u2019s right?<br><br>Explore a rich tapestry of weaponry and items, each imbued with its own unique attributes and abilities, allowing you to tailor your arsenal to confront any challenge that crosses your path.<br><br>Embark on a journey through a land ripe with opportunity, where a diverse skill system allows you to tailor your character\u2019s abilities to match your playstyle, ensuring a truly personalized adventure. Explore expansive maps and seek out long-lost relics, slumbering quietly with time.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991870/extras/f26a91283a546c2a7ebec5ab9728ebca.avif?t=1754198413\" width=616 height=347 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><br>Stylish combat with over-the-top exhilarating combos.<br>Explore a giant interconnected world riddled with monsters and machines.<br>Discover new abilities and upgrades, each further expanding the limits of exploration in the world.<br>Equip and customize rune arrangements with an interconnected system allowing for a wide array of personalized configurations.<br>More than 50 unique enemies!<br>More than 12 unique boss encounters!<br>A deep and compelling story, delivered in souls-like fashion.<br>Challenging AI to really keep you on your toes!<br>Unique side quests for those keen on deep-diving into the lore!<br>3D anime animation style.<br>Exceptional sonic journey.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991870/extras/1f743af0d60fa57f592fdfb32fdc5d05.poster.avif?t=1754198413\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991870/extras/1f743af0d60fa57f592fdfb32fdc5d05.webm?t=1754198413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
