ide array of personalized configurations.<br>More than 50 unique enemies!<br>More than 12 unique boss encounters!<br>A deep and compelling story, delivered in souls-like fashion.<br>Challenging AI to really keep you on your toes!<br>Unique side quests for those keen on deep-diving into the lore!<br>3D anime animation style.<br>Exceptional sonic journey.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991870/extras/1f743af0d60fa57f592fdfb32fdc5d05.poster.avif?t=1754198413\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991870/extras/1f743af0d60fa57f592fdfb32fdc5d05.webm?t=1754198413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
